<report>
<title>ROC Curve Analysis</title>
<p>@{chart:chart}</p>

<block name="datasets">
<p>Data set: @ti</p>

<p>Area under ROC curve by extended trapezoidal rule = @auc</p>

<p>Wilcoxon estimate of area under ROC curve = @theta<br />
DeLong standard error = @se:  <ci>@pc% CI = @ll to @ul</ci></p>

<p>Optimum cut-off point selected = @cut</p>

<table>
<tr><td><ci>Table at cut-off:</ci></td><td>a</td><td>b</td></tr>
<tr><td></td><td>@a</td><td>@b</td></tr>
<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td></td><td>c</td><td>d</td></tr>
<tr><td></td><td>@c</td><td>@d</td></tr>
</table>
<br />

<p><b>Predictive value of +ve test </b>(post-test likelihood of disease)<br />
@likely <ci>(@likely_from to @likely_to)</ci>, @likely_pc% <ci>(@likely_from_pc% to @likely_to_pc%)</ci>,  {change = @likely_change%}</p>

<p><b>Predictive values of -ve test</b><br />
(post-test likelihood of no disease)<br />
@likely_negative <ci>(@likely_negative_from to @likely_negative_to)</ci>, @likely_negative_pc% <ci>(@likely_negative_from_pc% to @likely_negative_to_pc%)</ci>,  {change = @likely_negative_change%}<br />
(post-test disease likelihood despite -ve test)<br />
@likely_despite <ci>(@likely_despite_from to @likely_despite_to)</ci>, @likely_despite_pc% <ci>(@likely_despite_from_pc% to @likely_despite_to_pc%)</ci>, {change = @likely_despite_change%}</p>

<p>sensitivity (@senspc% CI) = @sens  (@sensll to @sensul)<br />
<ci>specificity (@specpc% CI) = @spec  (@specll to @specul)</ci></p>
</block>
</report>
